        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present No. 21 Castlerock Road, Castleconnell to the market. This superb family home offers spacious, well-appointed accommodation, charming décor and an excellent layout, making it an ideal first-time purchase or a forever home for a growing family.\n\nLocated in the historic village of Castleconnell, the property enjoys the perfect balance of a peaceful countryside setting and excellent local amenities. Castlerock is within easy reach of a fantastic selection of shops, cafés, bars and restaurants, as well as the village playground and scenic riverside walks along the River Shannon. Castleconnell is situated approximately 14km from Limerick City, with convenient access to the M7 motorway network for commuters travelling to Dublin, Shannon Airport and beyond. The University of Limerick and Plassey Technological Park are just a short drive away, while a range of highly regarded primary and secondary schools including Castleconnell National School, Lisnagry National School, Castletroy College and Limerick Educate Together are all easily accessible.\n\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and beautifully presented throughout. The welcoming entrance hall features attractive wall panelling and a warm, neutral colour palette, with a guest WC conveniently located beneath the stairs. The flooring continues through to the generously proportioned living room, where a solid-fuel stove creates a cosy focal point. Double doors lead through to the kitchen/breakfast room, which overlooks the rear garden. The kitchen offers an excellent range of fitted units and comes complete with a built-in oven, gas hob and dishwasher. A striking feature wall with open shelving enhances the room's warm and inviting atmosphere. Patio doors open directly onto the rear garden and patio area, creating an ideal space for indoor-outdoor living and entertaining. Just off the kitchen is a practical utility room, plumbed for a washing machine and dryer, with additional storage, countertop space and a sink.\n\nUpstairs, there are four generous double bedrooms and the main family bathroom. The bathroom is fully tiled and fitted with a bath and overhead electric shower. The principal bedroom is tastefully decorated and benefits from built-in wardrobes and a stylishly tiled ensuite shower room. The remaining three bedrooms are all spacious, well presented and suitable for a variety of family needs.\n\nTo the front, the property provides off-street parking, while the rear boasts a private, low-maintenance garden. A paved patio area offers the perfect setting for al fresco dining and entertaining, complemented by a pergola positioned along the rear boundary which features a built-in pizza oven, creating an excellent outdoor entertaining space to enjoy with family and friends. A garden shed and lean-to at the side of the property provide excellent additional storage.\n\nNo. 21 Castlerock Road is a wonderful family home offering generous living accommodation, a spacious rear garden and an enviable location within one of County Limerick's most sought-after residential villages. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nServices: GFCH, mains water and mains sewerage.\n\nAccommodation: Entrance Hall, Guest WC, Living Room, Kitchen/Breakfast Room, Utility Room, 4 Double Bedrooms (Principal Ensuite) and Main Bathroom."
      },
